    "preamble": "Puran Das Beragi S/O Vishnu Das Beragi vs State Of Rajasthan on 26 July, 2021",
    "facts": "Counsel submitted that the petitioners have preferred an appeal under Section 70 of the Act of 2006 before the Food Safety Appellate Tribunal. Counsel submitted that after filing of the appeal, the appellate Tribunal is not regular sitting due to COVID-10 Pandemic and as such the appeal preferred by the petitioner has not been taken up for hearing so far. Counsel further submitted that there is no Presiding Officer, who is heading the appellate Tribunal.",
